{"tool_name":"super-resolution-radial-fluctuations-(srrf)-","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>SRRF is a high-performance analytical approach for Live-cell Super-Resolution Microscopy, provided as a fast GPU-enabled ImageJ plugin. SRRF is capable of extracting high-fidelity super-resolution information from TIRF, widefield and confocals using conventional fluorophores such as GFP. SRRF is capable of live-cell imaging over timescales ranging from minutes to hours.</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>SRRF is a high-performance analytical approach for Live-cell Super-Resolution Microscopy, provided as a fast GPU-enabled ImageJ plugin. SRRF is capable of extracting high-fidelity super-resolution information from TIRF, widefield and confocals using conventional fluorophores such as GFP. SRRF is capable of live-cell imaging over timescales ranging from minutes to hours.</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2023-05-03T09:13:20+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2017-02-22T10:41:42+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":3587,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"e97abb97-150e-4e5f-9b3a-1cc9e34e06f4","url":"/taxonomy/term/3587"},{"target_id":3588,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"5ccf13b3-afbe-4e82-ba93-a0d5824f93ed","url":"/taxonomy/term/3588"},{"target_id":4260,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"f72ae865-840c-4191-b292-215ace4fa165","url":"/taxonomy/term/4260"}],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1487761333,"last_comment_uid":43,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Nils Gustafsson"},{"value":"Si\u00e2n Culley"},{"value":"George Ashdown"},{"value":"Dylan M. Owen"},{"value":"Pedro Matos Pereira"},{"value":"Ricardo Henriques"}],"has_biological_terms":[{"target_id":4243,"target_type":"taxonomy_te